@startuml
skin rose
skinparam backgroundColor #EEEBDC
hide empty description

title Track Status Lifecycle

[*] --> Pending : Detected\nby Watcher
Pending -> Processing : Advance Pipeline

[*] --> Processing : System Recovery

Processing -l-> PausedWaitingUser : Interaction\nRequired
PausedWaitingUser --> Processing : Interaction\nResolved

state "Pipeline\nCheck" as PipelineCheck <<choice>>
Processing --> PipelineCheck : Stage\nCompleted

PipelineCheck --> Processing : [Has next stage]
PipelineCheck --> Completed : [Final stage]

Processing --> Failed : Unrecoverable\nerror

Failed --> [*]
Completed --> [*]

@enduml
